<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S NABI TO START TRADING ON AUGUST 1.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S NABI TO START TRADING ON AUGUST 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange set the first trading day in shares of in Hungarian busmaker North American Bus Industries (NABI) for August 1, the bourse said in the official bourse gazette.</p>
<p>NABI sought the listing of 4,470,000 shares with 1,000 forint face value each.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
